              <td class="p-3">Borderline capillary driving pressure; risk of low urine output.</td>
              <td class="p-3">Close observation, fluid challenge review.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-emerald-50/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
              <td class="p-3 font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600">65 – 100 mmHg</td>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">Optimal</td>
